{"title":"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8cd30262b223068d296258ee5429c479527b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y - 5)^{2} = (y - 9)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"21\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8cd30262b223068d296258ee5429c479527b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y - 5)^{2} = (y - 9)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"21\" />, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/9045cb8116fe42cb8c94bd015780a89641f48101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5 = y - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff3f670e6fa7076ad2654203868967eb5c6275f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5 = -(y - 9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/9045cb8116fe42cb8c94bd015780a89641f48101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5 = y - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" /> isn't possible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/69460559bd498909bfc59847bbf659fa9764449a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 9 = y - 5 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"17\" /> will always be smaller than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e700f8454a32f3730b55396e7eedefc06c622c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0ba2c04aead1b24f9008c514987c3b23a134106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5 = -(y - 9) = -y + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd3fea89bf8c8fc8605f9ee5aecfa0b1f02e833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + y = 9 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c95ed5cf149ad5450959c53e770749fd3577349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/2266c1553e90022a88f19f4d16f824caa94ffadf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{14}{2} = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/9906ef1f41ea40079e7a58517fda55c64b9d0cc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y - 5)^{2} - (y - 9)^{2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4ab01271d141832c75ed931d02c938eb14a13688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((y - 5) + (y - 9))((y - 5) - (y - 9)) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"328\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc558bccd0497de0a6654ff5f5b71e0ad5fa045.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2y - 14)(y - 5 - y + 9) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"226\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b8dc367194942a3ccb4e7ae7d5f56f13a9e1d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(2y - 14) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/47707538312f57a34f8d23b11def86cf1d0b6849.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y - 14 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" /> for the product to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c95ed5cf149ad5450959c53e770749fd3577349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/2266c1553e90022a88f19f4d16f824caa94ffadf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{14}{2} = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC\">2021 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Individual Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 1 Problem B</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual